<div class="section">Registration</div>

<p>
Registration of all conferences/workshops will be centrally managed by <a href="https://www.floc26.org">FLoC</a>.<br>
</p>

<p>
CMSB 2026 (as a "FLoC associated workshop") will have the following registration dates:<br>
- Early bird until June 1st.<br>
- Late until July 13th.<br>
</p>

<p>
More information at <a href="https://www.floc26.org/registration">https://www.floc26.org/registration</a>
<br>

</p>

